body:
The big draw of this list is that it responds to natural speech to denote time, like &#34;every other day&#34; or &#34;Friday&#34; or &#34;once a month.&#34; 
Also, you can ask Siri to add to your todoist, though she pronounces it comically badly. 
But so far, you can&#39;t combine the two. If Siri puts in &#34;call Bob tomorrow,&#34; you don&#39;t get &#34;call Bob&#34; set to be due tomorrow, you get a string of text &#34;call Bob tomorrow&#34; with no due date at all, and call Bob will never show up on your Today list. 🙁
